OL,3,GNEWSAPlastic factory suffers 'extensive
OL,4,Adamage' in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree business units have suffered
OL,7,F"extensive damage" after a fire broke
OL,8,Fout at a plastic packaging factory.
OL,10,FFlames ripped through the 40x90m
OL,11,F(131x295ft) M&H Plastics warehouse in
OL,12,FBeccles, Suffolk, and spread to
OL,13,Fneighbouring businesses on Monday
OL,14,Fafternoon.
OL,16,FFourteen crews were sent to London Road
OL,17,Fat 12:52 BST. It was under control by
OL,18,F23:00 and six crews remained on site on
OL,19,FTuesday morning to deal with any
OL,20,Fhotspots.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
