OL,3,GNEWSAPlastic factory suffers 'extensive
OL,4,Adamage' in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,7,Fthe affected buildings were "unstable"
OL,8,Fand urged people to avoid the area.
